    <!-- Handle bar (and the roll, which MAME also takes from the stick's X)
         on either stick, the paddle or the d-pad; the throttle lever on the
         right stick's Y, a trigger or the Throttle button (released 0x00,
         the game's VOLUME SETTING calibrates it 0x40-0xE0); the pitch on
         the left stick's Y. View. The safety sensor reads clear. OSD:
         Pedals, Steering, Steering smoothing, Right stick (shown for this
         game). -->
    <buttons names="Coin,Start,Test,Service,View,-,Throttle"/>
